<title>HUNGARY: CESI index firms, ends at 1,534.03 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index firms, ends at 1,534.03 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index rose 26.99 points or 1.79 percent on Friday to close at 1,534.03, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
